#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:5 082732ffdbf14dbfb49c4365cfaf605e
msgid "Slung Payload"
msgstr "悬挂载荷"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:10 2036528e208746769beec944b8032fdd
msgid ""
"For package delivery using a slung payload can be simpler and more reliable "
"than using a :ref:`winch <common-daiwa-winch>`"
msgstr "对于包裹投递，使用悬挂载荷可能比使用 :ref:`绞车 <common-daiwa-winch>` 更简单、更可靠"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:12 f9fa0297207e409791890dcd4df676ca
msgid ""
"Copter-4.6 (and higher) supports the `copter-slung-payload.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.lua>`__ script which can be used to reduce the oscillation of "
"the payload"
msgstr ""
"Copter-4.6（及更高版本）支持 `copter-slung-payload.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.lua>`__ 脚本，可用于减少载荷的摆动"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:15 21f36262c4924a0b8632b23b2d84189d
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:20 5442243d1c40452c859b202e51a63d23
msgid ""
"Mount an autopilot, GPS and telemetry radio to the payload.  This payload "
"autopilot must transmit the `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ mavlink "
"message to the autopilot at 10hz using a system id that is different from "
"the autopilot's.  In the video above a `Here4 GPS running ArduPilot "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/here-4/here-4-manual#id-8.-installing-ardupilot-on-here4>`__ was used"
" along with an ESP32 radio running `DroneBridge ESP32 "
"<https://github.com/DroneBridge/ESP32>`__.  A `ready-to-use device is "
"available from Japan Drones "
"<https://japandrones.com/shop/shopdetail.html?brandcode=000000000193>`__"
msgstr ""
"在载荷上安装飞控、GPS和数传电台。该载荷飞控必须以与飞控不同的系统ID，以10Hz的频率向飞控传输 `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ "
"MAVLink消息。在上面的视频中，使用了运行ArduPilot的 `Here4 GPS "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/here-4/here-4-manual#id-8.-installing-ardupilot-on-here4>`__ 以及运行 "
"`DroneBridge ESP32 <https://github.com/DroneBridge/ESP32>`__ 的ESP32电台。也有 "
"`来自Japan Drones的即用设备 "
"<https://japandrones.com/shop/shopdetail.html?brandcode=000000000193>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:21 ed1c91f8ef9f422fa1ed8a474b08944d
msgid ""
"The payload should be connected to the delivery vehicle with fishing line "
"(or equivalent).  Both ends of the fishing line should have fishing tackle "
"bearing swivels attached to allow the payload to rotate freely.  Two or "
"three fishing sinkers should be attached at 0.5m intervals to the end of the"
" line closest to the payload"
msgstr ""
"载荷应通过鱼线（或等效物）连接到投递飞行器。鱼线两端应各附有轴承旋转扣，使载荷可以自由旋转。在靠近载荷端的鱼线上以0.5米间距附加两到三个铅坠"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:22 47f6db1a88304ab0af28d647a84625c7
msgid ""
"The fishing line should be wound around a fishing line coiling plate "
"starting from the payload end"
msgstr "鱼线应从载荷端开始绕在鱼线收线板上"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:23 c97d96fcfd984e64b56372bae7280730
msgid ""
"The coiling plate should be attached to a heavy base board and placed "
"directly under the delivery vehicle so that the line uncoils smoothly as the"
" vehicle climbs"
msgstr "收线板应附在沉重的底板上，并直接放置在投递飞行器正下方，使鱼线在飞行器爬升时能够平顺放开"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:24 2b2c5677c6f543f7a92a31a58a2b4be2
msgid ""
"The delivery drone should have a :ref:`servo gripper <common-gripper-servo>`"
" allowing it to release the entire line during the :ref:`payload place "
"mission command <mission-command-list>`"
msgstr ""
"投递无人机应安装 :ref:`舵机抓手 <common-gripper-servo>`，使其在执行 :ref:`载荷放置任务指令 <mission-"
"command-list>` 时能够释放整条鱼线"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:47 a6409db8910e4503a160e1c7183b1ee7
msgid "Software Configuration and Testing"
msgstr "软件配置与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:49 836670e8dbcb42838c360620ac235896
msgid ""
"Install the `copter-slung-payload.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.lua>`__ script onto the delivery vehicle's autopilot (see "
":ref:`Lua script installation instructions here <common-lua-scripts>`)"
msgstr ""
"将 `copter-slung-payload.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.lua>`__ 脚本安装到投递飞行器的飞控上（参见 :ref:`Lua脚本安装说明 <common-lua-"
"scripts>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:50 aaa7aea0682644abaefacc5401ca6256
msgid ""
"Follow the \"How To Use\" section of the `copter-slung-payload.md file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.md>`__ including copying the `modules directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/modules>`__"
" to the vehicle's autopilot's SD card's scripts directory"
msgstr ""
"按照 `copter-slung-payload.md文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/copter-"
"slung-payload.md>`__ 的\"How To Use\"部分操作，包括将 `modules目录 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/modules>`__"
" 复制到飞行器飞控SD卡的scripts目录"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:51 92afac7393f3450a90f5769094afb566
msgid "Power on the vehicle and the payload's autopilot"
msgstr "启动飞行器和载荷的飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:52 da3cd8f1b6644ca98ba5a832a53bcece
msgid ""
"Connect to the vehicle's autopilot with a ground station (e.g. Mission "
"Planner) and confirm that both the vehicle and payload appear on the map.  "
"If they do not then there is likely an issue with the telemetry radios or "
"the delivery vehicle and payload's  sysid conflict (see :ref:`MAV_SYSID "
"<MAV_SYSID>`)"
msgstr ""
"用地面站（如 Mission "
"Planner）连接飞行器飞控，确认飞行器和载荷均显示在地图上。如果没有，则可能是数传电台存在问题，或飞行器与载荷的sysid冲突（参见 "
":ref:`MAV_SYSID <MAV_SYSID>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:53 a7341ff3de294e24a347ad74d50564d6
msgid ""
"Create an auto mission with SCRIPT_TIME and/or PAYLOAD_PLACE :ref:`mission "
"commands <mission-command-list>`"
msgstr ""
"创建包含SCRIPT_TIME和/或PAYLOAD_PLACE :ref:`任务指令 <mission-command-list>` 的自动任务"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:54 646ebfd3bcd64949a207920136470d9f
msgid ""
"Fly the mission and confirm that the delivery vehicle's autopilot reports, "
"\"copter-slung-payload: activated\" during the NAV_SCRIPT and/or "
"PAYLOAD_PLACE mission commands.  Also confirm the vehicle moves slightly "
"towards the payload when activated"
msgstr ""
"飞行任务，确认在NAV_SCRIPT和/或PAYLOAD_PLACE任务指令期间，投递飞行器的飞控报告\"copter-slung-payload: "
"activated\"。还需确认激活时飞行器向载荷方向略微移动"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:55 d956f15fcad94c9e96dfa3ec8040d212
msgid ""
"If the delivery vehicle moves strangely, simply switch the vehicle to a "
"different flight mode (e.g. Guide, RTL, etc) or advance the mission so that "
"neighter a NAV_SCRIPT nor PAYLOAD_PLACE command is executed"
msgstr ""
"如果投递飞行器运动异常，只需将飞行器切换到其他飞行模式（如Guided、RTL等）或推进任务，使得不再执行NAV_SCRIPT或PAYLOAD_PLACE指令"

#: ../../source/docs/slung-payload.rst:58 a2fd602f761b4a31ac7a5d0197c6798a
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
